  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Resource-intensive as VR already is, getting rid of Steam should give the performance a little boost.\nBesides performance, the reason why VRChat would be better with a standalone installer is the small application size, under 500MB is a perfect size for an installer.\nVRChat already has its own separate account database, many people don't have Steam and don't want to register a Steam account.\n\nTo be clear, I'm not saying VRChat should be pulled off Steam (no reason to), I'm just requesting an additional installer that doesn't require Steam, or at least an optional patch to make VRChat run separately without the need of Steam running in background.",
